Third-party binaries (not covered by the copyright notice above)

Prebuilt application bundles may ship executable files that are built from
upstream PurpleI2P projects:

  • i2pd (I2P daemon) — https://github.com/PurpleI2P/i2pd
    Licensed under BSD 3-Clause; see LICENSE in that repository.

  • i2pd-tools (command-line utilities bundled under Resources/tools/) —
    https://github.com/PurpleI2P/i2pd-tools
    Licensed under the terms stated in LICENSE (or equivalent) in that
    repository.

Those components remain under their respective licenses and copyrights; this
repository’s LICENSE applies to the Swift GUI source and assets maintained
here, not to re-distributed upstream binaries.
